---
source: crates/fauxfield/tests/cli.rs
expression: out
---
List and inspect Servers

Usage: fauxfield server [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list     List Servers
  add      Create a Server file
  rm       Delete a Server file (refused while a host is running unless --force)
  show     Show one Server with its Routes
  rename   Rename a Server; the file follows the slug, the ID stays
  enable   Enable a Server
  disable  Disable a Server
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -q, --quiet     Suppress informational output
      --no-color  Disable coloured output (also honoured: the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
